@startuml
title TMFC027 : Product Configurator

component "TMFC027 : Product Configurator" as TMFC027 {
  rectangle "eTOM L2 - Product Configuration Management" as eTOM1 #line.dashed
  rectangle "eTOM L3 - Manage Product Configuration" as eTOM2 #line.dashed
  database "Product Configuration*" as SID1
}

note bottom of SID1
  *only Product Configuration BEs (not Product Configuration Spec)
end note

' Dependent APIs enter the component on the left (socket connectors in the source image)
[TMF620 Product Catalog Mgmt] as dep1
[TMF622 Product Ordering] as dep2
[TMF632 Party Mgmt] as dep3
[TMF637 Product Inventory Mgmt] as dep4
[TMF662 Entity Catalog Mgmt] as dep5
[TMF666 Account Mgmt] as dep6
[TMF669 Party Role Mgmt] as dep7
[TMF673 Geographic Address Mgmt] as dep8
[TMF674 Geographic Site Mgmt] as dep9
[TMF921 Intent Mgmt] as dep10
[TMF701 Process Flow Mgmt] as dep11

dep1 --> TMFC027 : TMF620 Product Catalog Mgmt
dep2 --> TMFC027 : TMF622 Product Ordering
dep3 --> TMFC027 : TMF632 Party Mgmt
dep4 --> TMFC027 : TMF637 Product Inventory Mgmt
dep5 --> TMFC027 : TMF662 Entity Catalog Mgmt
dep6 --> TMFC027 : TMF666 Account Mgmt
dep7 --> TMFC027 : TMF669 Party Role Mgmt
dep8 --> TMFC027 : TMF673 Geographic Address Mgmt
dep9 --> TMFC027 : TMF674 Geographic Site Mgmt
dep10 --> TMFC027 : TMF921 Intent Mgmt
dep11 --> TMFC027 : TMF701 Process Flow Mgmt

' Exposed APIs leave the component on the right (lollipop connectors in the source image)
' NOTE: the component's Exposed APIs table (TMFC027.md section 3.1) also lists a
' fourth API, TMF688 "Event" (Optional) -- the source image itself omits it,
' the same way TMFC039's/TMFC002's own exposed-APIs diagrams omitted APIs absent
' from the drawing. Reproduced faithfully as three APIs, matching the image
' exactly, not reconciled against the table.
() "TMF679 Product Offering Qualification" as exp1
() "TMF760 Product Configuration" as exp2
() "TMF701 Process Flow Mgmt" as exp3

TMFC027 --> exp1 : TMF679 Product Offering Qualification
TMFC027 --> exp2 : TMF760 Product Configuration
TMFC027 --> exp3 : TMF701 Process Flow Mgmt

legend right
  eTOM Business Activities = dashed-outline rectangles
  SID Data Entities = cylinders
  Dependent APIs = socket connectors entering on the left
  Exposed APIs = lollipop connectors leaving on the right
endlegend
@enduml
